            "language": "zh-HK"
        },
        {
            "title": "即月期指開跌51點    低水77點",
            "description": "<div class=\"article-body\">\n<p class=\"font-size-scaler-control\" data-font=\"16\" style=\"font-weight: 400;\">即月期指開報22,150，跌51點或0.23%，低水77點。</p>\n<p class=\"font-size-scaler-control\" data-font=\"16\" style=\"font-weight: 400;\">科指期貨開報3,415，無升跌，低水2點。</p>\n<p class=\"font-size-scaler-control\" data-font=\"16\" style=\"font-weight: 400;\">國指期貨開報7,465，跌30點或0.27%，低水28點。</p>\n</div>",
